# Copy to .env and fill in the keys you actually have.
# .env is gitignored. Any link whose provider has no credential is skipped, so
# a partly filled file is fine — the chain just gets shorter.
#
# Check what resolved:  node bin/freechain.mjs --status

# ── Account slots ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every provider has numbered account slots, 0 through 9, plus the bare
# name. A slot is one account on that service. Rate limits are per account,
# so a chain link using the bare provider name fans out across every slot
# you have configured before it gives up and moves down the chain.
#
#   FREECHAIN_OPENROUTER_API_KEY   = ...   the bare account
#   FREECHAIN_OPENROUTER0_API_KEY  = ...   slot 0
#   FREECHAIN_OPENROUTER1_API_KEY  = ...   slot 1   ... up to slot 9
#
# Adding an account is an edit here, never an edit to chain.config.json.
# To pin a chain entry to one account, name the slot as its provider.

# ── Keys per slot ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Each slot accepts up to 10 keys, in three interchangeable forms:
#
#   FREECHAIN_OPENROUTER0_API_KEY    = sk-a             one key
#   FREECHAIN_OPENROUTER0_API_KEYS   = sk-a,sk-b,sk-c   comma or space list
#   FREECHAIN_OPENROUTER0_API_KEY_1  = sk-a             numbered, 1..10
#   FREECHAIN_OPENROUTER0_API_KEY_2  = sk-b
#
# Mix them freely; they combine in that order and duplicates are collapsed.
# 10 slots × 10 keys = up to 110 credentials per provider counting the bare
# account. Every provider below supports all of it.

# ── OpenRouter ── https://openrouter.ai/keys
FREECHAIN_OPENROUTER_API_KEYS=
# FREECHAIN_OPENROUTER0_API_KEYS=
# FREECHAIN_OPENROUTER1_API_KEYS=

# ── OpenCode Zen ── https://opencode.ai/zen
FREECHAIN_OPENCODE_ZEN_API_KEYS=
# FREECHAIN_OPENCODE_ZEN0_API_KEYS=

# ── OmniRoute ── self-hosted router on loopback, usually needs no key
# FREECHAIN_OMNIROUTE_API_KEY=

# ── Optional extras ── add matching entries to chain.config.json to use
# FREECHAIN_LONGCAT_API_KEYS=
# FREECHAIN_GROQ_API_KEYS=
# FREECHAIN_CEREBRAS_API_KEYS=
# FREECHAIN_NVIDIA_API_KEYS=
# FREECHAIN_DEEPSEEK_API_KEYS=
# FREECHAIN_GOOGLE_API_KEYS=
# FREECHAIN_OPENAI_API_KEYS=

# ── Server ──
# FREECHAIN_PORT=4853
# FREECHAIN_HOST=127.0.0.1
